  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d5562cc34807e2439c5cc188b7351d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dlg_Teach_OS_07_EditionSelect
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSequence
  lines:
  - speakerName: Guide
    text: The edition is not cosmetic. Home has no domain join, no Group Policy Editor,
      no BitLocker and no Remote Desktop host. Any unit destined for the server you
      set up in COC 3 has to be Pro or better - and 64-bit, or it cannot address
      more than about 4GB of the RAM you just installed.
